    "standardized_narrative": "At 31 December 2016 gross claims outstanding opened at GBP 540.543m. During the year the syndicate recorded favourable prior-year development, with a gross improvement of GBP 40.5m (a ~7.5% release relative to opening reserves), driven primarily by favourable claims development on back years and specific favourable court rulings (notably a Hurricane Sandy related claim), partially offset by selective adverse development such as a top-up on an old Energy claim following a Danish court decision. The releases were particularly evident in Property and Cyber allocations, while Energy saw some strengthening.",
